772
01:07:48,340 --> 01:07:49,674
Benny.

773
01:07:50,842 --> 01:07:52,109
Benny.

774
01:07:52,578 --> 01:07:55,179
O que? O que?
O que, Mickey? O que?

775
01:07:56,014 --> 01:07:57,648
Você escutou aquilo?

776
01:07:58,016 --> 01:07:59,116
O que?

777
01:08:00,385 --> 01:08:02,219
Merda!

778
01:08:02,219 --> 01:08:03,521
Oh merda, oh merda!

779
01:08:03,521 --> 01:08:05,389
